👑🧠 Birbal and the Clever Answer (Raw Story)

One day, Emperor Akbar asked a strange question in his court.

He said, “What is the fastest thing in the world?”

Many courtiers gave answers.

One said, “The wind is the fastest.”

Another said, “Light is the fastest.”

Akbar then asked Birbal.

Birbal smiled and said, “The fastest thing is the human mind.”

Akbar asked, “How is that?”

Birbal replied, “Because in a moment, the mind can travel anywhere—near or far.”

Akbar was pleased with the answer.

💖 Moral:

The human mind is powerful and can go beyond limits.
